/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Blueprint Class: BP_AtmosphericLightingSetup
Asset Path: /Game/Blueprints/Environment/BP_AtmosphericLightingSetup
Target Parent: AActor
Description:
   Physically-based atmospheric lighting and post-processing controller.
   Configures Sun (DirectionalLight), SkyAtmosphere, SkyLight (DFAO),
   Volumetric Exponential Height Fog, and Unbound Post-Process Volume.
================================================================================

COMPONENT HIERARCHY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- DefaultSceneRoot (SceneComponent)
  ├── DirectionalLight_Sun (DirectionalLightComponent)
  │     - Mobility: Movable
  │     - Intensity: 85,000.0 Lux (Direct high-noon/afternoon daylight)
  │     - LightColor: (255, 248, 238) [5600K Clean Sunlight]
  │     - AtmosphereSunLight: True (Atmosphere Sun Light Index 0)
  │     - CastCloudShadows: True
  │     - DynamicShadowDistanceMovableLight: 45,000.0 cm (450m cascade radius)
  │     - CascadeDistributionExponent: 3.0
  │     - NumDynamicShadowCascades: 4
  │     - ContactShadowLength: 0.15 (Pin-sharp tire contact shadows)
  │     - RelativeRotation: Pitch -26.0 deg, Yaw 142.0 deg, Roll 0.0 deg
  │
  ├── SkyAtmosphereComponent (SkyAtmosphereComponent)
  │     - BottomRadius: 6360.0 km (Earth standard)
  │     - AtmosphereHeight: 60.0 km
  │     - GroundAlbedo: (0.15, 0.15, 0.15)
  │     - RayleighScattering: (0.058, 0.135, 0.331) [Realistic blue atmosphere]
  │     - RayleighExponentialDistribution: 8.0 km
  │     - MieScattering: (0.00399, 0.00399, 0.00399) [Atmospheric aerosol haze]
  │     - MieAbsorption: (0.00044, 0.00044, 0.00044)
  │     - MieAnisotropy: 0.82 (Forward solar halo glare)
  │     - MieExponentialDistribution: 1.2 km
  │     - AbsorptionScale: 1.0 (Ozone layer absorption enabled)
  │     - AerialPerspectiveViewDistanceScale: 1.2 (Enhances distance depth perception)
  │
  ├── SkyLight (SkyLightComponent)
  │     - Mobility: Movable
  │     - RealTimeCapture: True
  │     - Intensity: 1.25 cd/m²
  │     - LowerHemisphereIsBlack: False
  │     - LowerHemisphereColor: (0.08, 0.07, 0.06) [Soil & asphalt bounce]
  │     - DistanceFieldAmbientOcclusion (DFAO): Enabled
  │
  ├── ExponentialHeightFog (ExponentialHeightFogComponent)
  │     - FogDensity: 0.0018
  │     - FogHeightFalloff: 0.0008
  │     - FogInscatteringLuminance: (0.75, 0.85, 1.0)
  │     - FogCutoffDistance: 2,500,000.0 cm (25 km horizon cutoff)
  │     - bEnableVolumetricFog: True
  │     - VolumetricFogScatteringDistribution: 0.45
  │     - VolumetricFogAlbedo: (0.9, 0.9, 0.95)
  │     - VolumetricFogExtinctionScale: 1.0
  │     - VolumetricFogViewDistance: 35,000.0 cm (350m high-res volumetric beams)
  │
  └── PostProcessVolume (PostProcessComponent)
        - bUnbound: True (Affects whole 50km level)
        - Settings:
          * MOTION BLUR (Crucial for 300+ km/h speed feel):
            - Amount: 0.65 (High-speed peripheral streak)
            - MaxPercent: 100.0%
            - TargetFPS: 60

          * BLOOM:
            - Method: BloomMethod_Convolution (Photorealistic lens bloom)
            - Intensity: 0.75
            - Threshold: 1.15
